# Line-ending normalization.
#
# Without this, the whole tree showed up as modified on Windows: 7,443
# insertions / 7,328 deletions that `git diff --ignore-all-space` reported as
# empty. The repo stores LF and checks out LF everywhere, so the phantom diff
# cannot come back.
#
# Existing files were brought in line once with `git add --renormalize .`.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff as text.
*.pdf   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
